:: Home Console Suika
<<set $outside to 0>>
<<if $location isnot "home" and $location isnot "alex_cottage" and $location isnot "arcology_launch">><<set $location to "home">><</if>>
<<effects>>
<<furnitureicon "controller">>당신은 과일 게임을 시작한다. 과일을 병에 떨어뜨리면 같은 과일 두 개가 합쳐져 더 큰 과일이 된다.
<br><br>
<<nobr>><div id="suika" class="suika no-numberify">
	<div class="suika-play">
		<div class="suika-modes" role="group" aria-label="게임 모드">
			<button type="button" class="suika-btn suika-mode" data-mode="classic" aria-pressed="true">클래식</button>
			<button type="button" class="suika-btn suika-mode" data-mode="arcade" aria-pressed="false">아케이드</button>
			<button type="button" class="suika-btn suika-mode" data-mode="zen" aria-pressed="false">젠</button>
		</div>
		<div class="suika-goal" hidden>
			<span class="suika-goal-name"></span>
			<span class="suika-goal-text"></span>
			<div class="suika-goal-bar" role="progressbar" aria-label="목표 진행도" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" hidden></div>
		</div>
		<div class="suika-tip" role="region" aria-label="안내" hidden></div>
		<div class="suika-hud">
			<span class="tama-stat"><span class="tama-k">점수</span><span class="tama-v suika-score">0</span></span>
			<span class="tama-stat"><span class="tama-k suika-best-label">최고</span><span class="tama-v suika-best"><<print $suikaBest or 0>></span></span>
			<span class="tama-stat suika-next"><span class="tama-k">다음</span><span class="tama-v"><canvas class="suika-next-dot" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><span class="suika-next-name"></span></span></span>
		</div>
		<div class="suika-board" data-gesture-owner="fruit">
			<canvas class="suika-canvas" tabindex="0" aria-label="과일 게임 병. 좌우 방향키로 조준하고, 스페이스로 떨어뜨리고, 숫자 키로 파워업을 쓰고, P로 일시정지합니다."></canvas>
			<div class="suika-toast" role="status" hidden></div>
			<div class="suika-overlay" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="suika-overlay-title" hidden>
				<span class="suika-overlay-title" id="suika-overlay-title"></span>
				<span class="suika-overlay-text"></span>
				<ul class="suika-overlay-extra" hidden></ul>
				<div class="suika-overlay-buttons">
					<button type="button" class="suika-btn suika-overlay-btn"></button>
					<button type="button" class="suika-btn suika-overlay-btn2" hidden></button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<canvas class="suika-legend" role="img" aria-label="과일 순서, 작은 것부터 큰 것까지: 체리, 딸기, 포도, 데코폰, 감, 사과, 배, 복숭아, 파인애플, 멜론, 수박"></canvas>
		<div class="suika-abilities" role="group" aria-label="아케이드 파워업" hidden></div>
		<div class="suika-controls">
			<button type="button" class="suika-btn suika-pause">일시정지</button>
			<button type="button" class="suika-btn suika-menu" aria-haspopup="true">메뉴</button>
			<button type="button" class="suika-btn suika-restart">다시 시작</button>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="suika-panel" role="region" hidden></div>
	<div class="suika-status suika-sr" aria-live="polite"></div>
</div><</nobr>>
<<run setup.suika.open()>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[콘솔로 돌아간다|Home Console]]>><<run setup.suika.leave()>><</link>>
<br>
